  "title": "Barclays Report Shows Travelers Rely on Rewards",
  "summary": "While concerns about costs and the economy are prompting some travelers to rethink their plans, many are still prioritizing personal trips. Whether it’s a long weekend getaway or a big vacation, travelers are turning to loyalty programs to make the most of their experiences. However, a closer look reveals differences in loyalty program usage, spending habits and travel preferences across demographics.",
